[I] Cassandra CPP Driver

[T] The DataStax C/C++ Driver is a modern, feature-rich and highly tunable
[T] client library for Apache Cassandra 2.1+ that uses exclusively
[T] Cassandra's binary protocol and CQL v3. It also works with DataStax
[T] Enterprise and Astra and supports asynchronous I/O, connection pooling
[T] and load balancing policies.

[U] https://docs.datastax.com/en/developer/cpp-driver/index.html

[A] Cassandra-cpp-driver Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

